  "id": "functional-distance",
  "term": "functional distance",
  "definition": "Functional distance is a way of describing how different two urban regions are in their social functions rather than how far apart they are physically. In this source, it is defined as the Euclidean distance between vectors representing the regions’ social-function profiles.",
